{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5","id":1514355,"title":"Renegade Game Studios: Announce BLOOD STAINED LOVE; A Romance Supplement for V5","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-09T16:46:17-07:00","id":1514355,"title":"Renegade Game Studios: Announce BLOOD STAINED LOVE; A Romance Supplement for V5","content":"Coming Next year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T16:47:06-07:00","id":1514356,"title":"","content":"There will be a Oblivion Ceremony related to romance apaprently!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T17:03:06-07:00","id":1514359,"title":"","content":"Some other things mentioned:<ul><li>One of the Oblivion-rituals is just a copy-paste of something in Blood Sigils apparently</li> <li>The book goes over how to handle romance in the game and session zero stuff which... seems a bit redundant. Both the V5 corebook and the V5 Players Guide have sections talking about that. So I don't know why you need another book just dealing with the same topic yet again.</li> <li>One Merit that was mentioned was called &quot;Up All Night&quot; which allows you to treat your Humanity as one or two higher as long as romance is involved.</li> <li>The preview Discipline was &quot;Wingman&quot; which is about giving Presence powers to somebody else.</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T17:03:44-07:00","id":1514360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514356#post1514356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There will be a Oblivion Ceremony related to romance apaprently!</div> </div> </div> </div>Since it's most likely to be a necromancy ceremony, and necromancy is usually associated with death and the dead, I hypothesize that it has something to do with Romeo and Juliet.<br /> <br /> Weak reasoning, I know.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T17:57:54-07:00","id":1514364,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514356#post1514356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There will be a Oblivion Ceremony related to romance apaprently!</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a Giovanni joke to be made there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T23:15:39-07:00","id":1514398,"title":"","content":"I'm not against the concept, though I am wary since I don't trust Vampire with such things; I don't need several pages just for<i> &quot;Vampires are never allowed anything positive or happy or worthwhile that would actually give a purpose to continuing to exist, ever. Drown in this paddling pool of tragedy and misery. Angst, damn you! Angst!&quot;</i><br /> <br /> I can't imagine what Oblivion could do here. I assume it's either about destroying love or &quot;resurrecting&quot; a lost love. And I assume it's Necromancy, because I dread to think how Obtenebration could be romantic.<br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">...though you wouldn't think the Giovanni would need to rely on necromancy for dates so much now, considering they're closer with their walking corpse-looking sister-bloodlines...</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T00:02:36-07:00","id":1514410,"title":"","content":"Seems an odd choice for print, I'm guessing that limited scope of setting and relectance to incorporate older ideas leaves them a little short on ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T00:18:51-07:00","id":1514414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514410#post1514410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seems an odd choice for print, I'm guessing that limited scope of setting and relectance to incorporate older ideas leaves them a little short on ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the only way I could see any value in this book is that it gives you more Disciplines and Merits/Flaws. But I wonder if they're actually willing to dive into Clan/Sect-specific lore when it comes to romance and relationships (while maybe even touch on old lore). The way they dealt with loresheets in the V5 Players Guide it doesn't seem like they're fans of the idea of exploring the lore of V5. My fear is that that it will be a whole chapter or so of that style-tendency that occasionally crops up in these books where the text is mulling over a simple point for multiple paragraphs just repeating the same simple idea over and over again...<br /> <br /> As for gaming-advice you had a section on Kindred Intimacy in the corebook, a section on &quot;Sexual Violence in Games&quot; in the Appendix of the same book and then another section on &quot;Romance, Seduction and Sex&quot; in the V5 Players Guide. Lines and Veils, X-Cards, talking about close relationships with Touchstones... all of that has also been already covered. I mean, what more do you need to say about that topic...?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T00:42:49-07:00","id":1514418,"title":"","content":"I mean I've seen a fuckton of online V5 games that are basically supernatural romances, I mean they have to handwave 90% of the mechanics to get there but there's a fair few Discord games that are 'V5' but are actually just free-form RP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T01:00:32-07:00","id":1514419,"title":"","content":"To be worth it, this game <i>should</i> be about mechanics. I mean, do we need an instruction manual on the vamp romance genre? Most people I know are familiar with some variant of it (usually elements of Anne Rice, the Buffyverse, Twilight...)<br /> I also don't really think we need to know how clans involve themselves with relationships. Yeah, ok, Clan stereotypes are a useful starting point, but personal relationships are still individual so I'm not feeling it... Although I would like to know how the core 7 respond to you dating one of the weirdos. (Lasombra? You masochist. Tzimisce? Kinky! Ravnos? Enjoy your social pariah status together. Setite? Hmmmm. Assamite? Do you have a death wish. Giovanni? Enjoy your in-laws from hell.)<br /> <br /> The topic's been touched on in previous books, as others have mentioned (sufficiently in my opinion). So the only thing worthwhile is mechanics expanding on using the romance genre for your chronicle tennets. The Up All Night merit mentioned is the kind of thing I picture when I think of bringing romance into a VtM game.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T01:07:02-07:00","id":1514420,"title":"","content":"I mean...Up All Night is certainly a very &quot;13 year old giggling behind their hands&quot; name for that Merit....<br /> <br /> Doesn't really bode well for a mature and nuanced take on the subject.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T01:28:16-07:00","id":1514423,"title":"","content":"So... Eternal Hearts electric boogaloo?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T16:03:06-07:00","id":1514523,"title":"","content":"When I heard about this yesterday, I thought the person who told me was pulling my leg. I wish he had been. The little they\u2019ve shown so far is already cringey; I have to imagine the rest might be even worse.<br /> <br /> There are so many areas of V5 worthy of expansion, yet this is where they choose to go? I honestly feel like this is a bad sign for the future of the line.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26481-tiltowait","name":"tiltowait","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26481_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T16:51:04-07:00","id":1514524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tiltowait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514523#post1514523\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I heard about this yesterday, I thought the person who told me was pulling my leg. I wish he had been. The little they\u2019ve shown so far is already cringey; I have to imagine the rest might be even worse.<br /> <br /> There are so many areas of V5 worthy of expansion, yet this is where they choose to go? I honestly feel like this is a bad sign for the future of the line.</div> </div> </div> </div>fwiw vampire: the requiem had a very similar book and requiem is pretty great","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T17:40:29-07:00","id":1514527,"title":"","content":"The fact they\u2019re choosing this for a sourcebook as opposed to the many areas that actually need exploration is worrying. <br /> Sure, getting new Disciplines is nice, but with the 5 powers cap, it\u2019s going to get a bit overloaded for choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27967-caerolion","name":"Caerolion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T23:41:18-07:00","id":1514552,"title":"","content":"Do we know who will be writing it? Cult of the Blood Gods was good. But this will done by Renegade Studio's itself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7279-ichneumon","name":"Ichneumon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7279_6.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-11T00:57:22-07:00","id":1514555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ichneumon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514552#post1514552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do we know who will be writing it? Cult of the Blood Gods was good. But this will done by Renegade Studio's itself?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, this will be done by Renegade. Just like H5: Lines Drawn In Blood and the upcoming Alma Maters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-11T04:19:58-07:00","id":1514567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514524#post1514524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">fwiw vampire: the requiem had a very similar book and requiem is pretty great</div> </div> </div> </div>While it's a good book, Strange Dead Love was the second to last VtR 1e supplement (only followed by a book for making your own blood sorcery rituals and some rules hacks for that in general). Quality or not, it doesn't address how odd it is to pick this topic over so many other things to put up first. If it was going to be something closer to Invite Only (at VtR 1e book that's more broadly about vampire social unlife, from personal relationships to the subtle politics of courtly formal balls), I could see the case here.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caerolion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514527#post1514527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure, getting new Disciplines is nice, but with the 5 powers cap, it\u2019s going to get a bit overloaded for choice.</div> </div> </div> </div>That ship has already sailed for most of the V5 Disciplines at this point. Between Blood Sorcery and Oblivion both being high on the number of options as it is, and the full set of Clans leading to a bunch of new Amalgam powers to keep their signature powers without adding more full Disciplines, there's been a fairly steady creep of Discipline power/Amalgam bloat already.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ichneumon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514552#post1514552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do we know who will be writing it? Cult of the Blood Gods was good. But this will done by Renegade Studio's itself?</div> </div> </div> </div>Cult of the Blood Gods was Onyx Path.<br /> <br /> This is, as noted, going to be from Renegade, and might be our first real glimpse at the kind of writing we'll see out of them once they're let loose to work on books that aren't as heavily overseen by Paradox.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-11T06:50:39-07:00","id":1514574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514567#post1514567\