s of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-11T22:58:41-07:00","id":1514655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514626#post1514626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love these kinds of books.<br /> <br /> However, everything Renegade has done for V5 has undermined what I loved from OPP.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh? Could you go into more detail regarding this statement? I have similar feelings, but I Iike hearing other's thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27814-agornitha","name":"Agornitha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27814_1.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T05:47:43-07:00","id":1514686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514585#post1514585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Second Inquistion was Achilli's stewardship with freelancers and published by Renegade. You're correct on the rest. But none of them are out yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the sense he was still a member of the WoD team at the time yes. Looking at the credits page there isn\u2019t a member of the WoD staff listed under writers, developers, artist, or any other credited role besides as the WoD team. In comparison The Sabbat and Player\u2019s Guide have just about everyone except Sean from WoD credited. I don\u2019t see anything to indicate it had any more oversight than the other upcoming Renegade books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T05:58:01-07:00","id":1514688,"title":"","content":"V5 is (like I said many times in the past) basically Twilight at this point. <br /> <br /> Why, just why","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T10:34:10-07:00","id":1514717,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agornitha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514355-renegade-game-studios-announce-blood-stained-love-a-romance-supplement-for-v5?p=1514655#post1514655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh? Could you go into more detail regarding this statement? I have similar feelings, but I Iike hearing other's thoughts.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not much more than I found INQUISITION and SABBAT to be very action-orientated, mininum role-playing, and canon-ignoring/shredding books. OPP tried to thread the needle of the big setting changes.<br /> <br /> Renegade sort of just smashed through it with a wrecking ball.<br /> <br /> CHICACGO BY NIGHT 5th Edition is one of my favorite books and so is CULTS OF THE BLOOD GODS.<br /> <br /> Inquisition and Sabbat are some of the worst. Taken on their own, they're okay if you want to run Blade (exempting some RL issues). Not so much if you want to run V:TM.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T11:03:42-07:00","id":1514721,"title":"","content":"Sex sells, but it usually comes with a side of cringe. <br /> <br /> Do I trust these fellows to write something passable? No, not at all. Based on the 'up all night' merit I'm going to guess the route of -we made love for more than eight hours and it didn't get boring after 15 minutes because this is fantasy- which is... Ok, I guess. At best, Maybe if I read this book I might decide my cities need at least one vampire couple that spends more than half of every night in a blood loop","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T11:56:05-07:00","id":1514727,"title":"","content":"Examination reveals that the &quot;Up All Night&quot; merit allows you to act like your humanity is higher for stuff like the blush, eating and fucking which feels... shallow. I was - despite the name - expecting something like True Love, except affecting humanity instead of willpower, where a deep emotional connection gives you strength to keep caring and resist the Beast. Y'know, passion, melodrama, forbidden love, genuine affection between incredibly fucked up individuals - the Gothic genre stuff Vampire's supposed to utilise alongside the Punk.<br /> <br /> On a different note: Tiktok?? How is <i>Tiktok</i> an &quot;alternative play technique&quot;? What does that even mean?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><sup><i>Prone to hyperbole</i></sup>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26836-rhywbeth","name":"Rhywbeth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T12:22:47-07:00","id":1514732,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container